# External Audits

This directory stores external audit reports and third-party assessment results.

## Access

- Read: Security Lead, Compliance Officer
- Write: Compliance Officer only

## Naming Convention

Files should follow the pattern: `external-audit-YYYY-MM-DD-[firm]-[scope].pdf`

## Confidentiality

External audit reports are classified as **Confidential**. Do not share outside the organization without Compliance Officer approval.

## Retention

All external audit reports are retained for 7 years per `policies/data-retention-policy.md`.
